   "text": "Luiss University - Libera Università Internazionale degli Studi Sociali Guido Carli - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLuiss University - Libera Università Internazionale degli Studi Sociali Guido Carli\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe Libera Università Internazionale degli Studi Sociali \"Guido Carli\" founded by a group of entrepreneurs led by Umberto Agnelli, brother of Gianni Agnelli. It provides undergraduate and post-graduate education, in addition to a range of Double Degree programs, in the fields of finance, business, management, law and political science. It is located near the historical center of the city, between the neighborhoods of Parioli and Trieste.Luis is ranked #261 in the world and #11 in Italy by QS.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n14/05/2026 11:06\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n13/03/2026 06:09\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nItaly\nYearly Fees\nMax: €13,473.00\nMin: €11,548.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n900 of 9,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1974\nCampus(es)\nRome\nCountry\nItaly\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n20/01/2026\nContract End Date\n30/09/2026\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nExpiring in 60 days\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fUrZc7XkZuo\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nNo commission is paid if the student receives any other public or private exemption (integral or partial) from payment of university fees (e.g., “esonero DiscoLazio” or similar).\nNo commission for Foundation Programme: If a student in the Foundation Programme is awarded a scholarship, no commission is paid\nOnline delivery non-commissionable",
